## Report Overview

**44 items** across 3 columns from the 2026-07-26 research data:

### Column 1 — New Products (40% width, 5 items)
- **Clark** — autonomous AI coworker with its own cloud computer
- **Juggler** — open-source GUI AI coding agent (278 HN points)
- **Unabyss for Claude** — MCP-native context/memory layer (#1 on PH)
- **ADE** — parallel AI coding agent orchestrator
- **FluentDB** — macOS AI database client

### Column 2 — Whitelist Updates (35% width, 21 items)
Covers releases from **Claude Code** (Opus 5 default), **GitHub Copilot** (Opus 5 + Cloud Agent GA), **Devin** (Outposts, model picker), **Codex CLI** (Multi-Agent V2, Bedrock), **Cursor** (Router, Agent Swarms), **Gemini CLI** (v0.51–v0.53), **Windsurf/Continue** (wind-down complete).

### Column 3 — Technical Insights (25% width, 18 items)
Key stories include the **OpenAI→Hugging Face sandbox escape** analysis, **Claude Opus 5** launch coverage, **Ruff v0.16.0** AI-assisted auto-fix, the **"lean harness" fireside chat**, and Nik Suresh's **AI mania** report.

### Design Features
- **Hacker News-inspired** color scheme (#f6f6ef bg, #ff6600 accent)
- **Responsive** 3-column grid that collapses to 2 columns at 1100px and 1 column at 700px
- **Embedded CSS** — no external dependencies for fast loading
